  "jobTitle": "Embedded Software Engineer",
  "summary": "Software Engineer with 4 years of experience in embedded systems, firmware development, and application development, currently completing a Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science. I specialize in building and maintaining software systems for vehicle electrification platforms, including embedded firmware, telematics, and integrated display interfaces.\n \nIn my current role, I work across hardware and software layers to develop microcontroller-based systems for monitoring, control, and diagnostics. I also contribute to web-based interfaces and tools that support vehicle data visualization and system interaction. This has given me hands-on experience with end-to-end system development, debugging, and deployment in real-world environments.\n \nI enjoy solving complex technical problems, working independently on full feature development, and continuously improving my skills across both embedded and software engineering domains. I’m looking to grow as a software engineer by expanding into broader system development, full-stack integration, and scalable software solutions.",
